#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Update Engine
#  File: update_engine.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS update engine responsible for:
#      • version synchronization
#      • delta update application
#      • rollback snapshotting
#      • update integrity verification
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Version Tracking](ca://s?q=Explain_Version_Tracking)
#    - [Delta Updates](ca://s?q=Explain_Delta_Updates)
#    - [Rollback System](ca://s?q=Explain_Rollback_System)
#    - [Integrity Verification](ca://s?q=Explain_Update_Integrity_Verification)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - register_update(version, checksum, delta)
#         Registers an update package.
#
#    - verify(version)
#         Validates SHA‑256 checksum.
#
#    - apply(version)
#         Applies update and creates rollback point.
#
#    - rollback(rollback_id)
#         Restores previous version.
#
#    - state()
#         Returns full update engine state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  UPDATE PACKAGE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "version": "1.1.0",
#      "checksum": "<sha256>",
#      "delta": <binary patch>
#    }
#
#===============================================================================
